  "reviews": [
    {
      "author": "MovieGuys",
      "content": "\"Blood Sacrifice\" is yet another reason I don't pay a subscription for Netflix.\r\n\r\nIn brief, a predictable story, loaded down with bland narrative and superficial characterizations with lashings of woke slop.\r\n\r\nWholly limited upsides include decent acting and cinematography. \r\n\r\nIn short, a mediocre crime drama from Sweden with the usual baggage train of irritating DEI nagging. A basic watch at best. \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n&nbsp;",
